WEBVTT

00:06:27.387 --> 00:06:30.625
when the power grid
runs on renewable energy,

00:06:30.649 --> 00:06:33.661
when the school curriculum teaches us

00:06:33.685 --> 00:06:36.919
that taking care of the Earth
is part of our humanity,

00:06:38.008 --> 00:06:40.619
maybe I can do gymnastics once again.

00:06:40.942 --> 00:06:42.441
Don't you think so, Abuelita?

00:06:42.966 --> 00:06:44.116
We can do this.

00:06:44.569 --> 00:06:46.157
All I'm trying to do with my work

00:06:46.181 --> 00:06:49.189
is give that optimistic mindset
to other people.

00:06:49.879 --> 00:06:51.425
But it's been a little hard.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.047
There is greed,

00:06:53.071 --> 00:06:54.490
there's pride,

00:06:54.514 --> 00:06:55.766
there's money,

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.291
and there's materialism.

00:06:57.315 --> 00:07:00.478
People make it so easy
for me to talk to them,